"1. Issue writ in the nature of mandamus to direct all the respondent authorities to initiate the acquisition proceedings under Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation & Resettlement Act, 2013, in respect of petitioners land is concerned which were submerged during the process of the opening of the crest gate of Tungabhadra Dam;
2. Issue writ in the nature of mandamus to directing the respondents to consider the representation dated 04.07.2016 vide Annexure-D respectively in so far as petitioners lands are concerned."
